 "definitions": {
  "D1_fit": "window = tail-depth cycles (E/L rule: every solve record of round k has compl_inf_tol_in_force == 1e-6). PRIMARY: E.settling_bar(series, cycles=window, W=20, h=3): r_fit from OLS of ln|step| on the window minus its last 3 cycles; held-out H = max abs error of its predictions on the last 3; r from all steps; projected limit Q_hat_inf = X(K) + d_K r / (1 - r). Recorded beside: the limit implied by the held-out fit alone, X(k0) + d_k0 r_fit / (1 - r_fit) (k0 the last fitted cycle); and LSQ3: X(k) = L + A r^(k - k_first) by least squares on the window minus its last 3 (r grid 0.001..0.999 step 0.001 + golden refinement, linear L, A), held-out error on the last 3, boundary flag when r hits the grid edge",
  "D2": "per coordinate: mu~_T = w_T x admm_objective_scale_tso x lambda_T / (tso_base_mva x R_MVA) (P, Q; EUR per MW / MVAr), w_T x scale_T x lambda_T / v_b,T^2 (V; EUR per kV); mu~_D likewise with w_D (capture per_agent DSO weight), admm_objective_scale_dso, dso_base_mva, v_b,D (capture DSO v / interface_voltage_terminal dso_pu). Each mu~ is the EUR coefficient the side's objective places on ITS OWN copy (CODE_LINES 5852/5868, 6125/6148, 4505/4537 with the Param = stored / base). Residual r = x_T - x_D on the channel the dual update uses (expectation: Pbar_T - Pbar_D; deviation: d_T,s - d_D,s). EUR value per coordinate: (mu~_T + mu~_D) x r (deviation: x omega_s). Aggregates per run / cycle / block / channel / kind: max |mu~_T + mu~_D|, omega-RMS (sqrt(sum_s omega_s mean_{dn,t} x^2); expectation: RMS over dn, t), max |mu~_T|, EUR signed sum, EUR absolute sum, count of stored duals with lambda_T == -lambda_D exactly. Plus rho_T == rho_D (pf and v) per block at every captured cycle",
  "D2_equal_and_opposite": "\"equal and opposite\" := mu~_D = -mu~_T at every coordinate, i.e. the DSO's EUR coefficient on its own copy x_D is minus the TSO's EUR coefficient on its own copy x_T -- what one Lagrangian term lambda (x_T - x_D) would give both sides. From the update lines (9251/9261, 9250/9260, 4690-4694): mu_T += rho_T r s_base_T / R and mu_D += rho_D (-r) s_base_D / R from mu = 0, so mu_T + mu_D = 0 exactly when rho_T = rho_D and s_base_T = s_base_D at every update (and the EUR conversions agree when w_T scale_T = w_D scale_D)",
  "D3": "terminal state. TSO P/Q: interface_settlement_detail_s31c.json delta_p_mw / delta_q_mvar per (DN, block, period, scenario) (= interface_delta x s_base, the copy each scenario references) against [-R, +R] (R = interface_rating_mva), i.e. P_T,s against anchor_p_mw (= pc_init) +- R; margin = R - |delta|; active iff margin <= 1e-6 x max(1, R); near-active iff margin / R < 1e-3. Cross-check (coupled): anchor + delta_s against the capture terminal Pbar_T + d_T,s. Beside: (i) the same TSO box at every cycle >= 21 from the capture with the terminal anchor (pc is fixed); (ii) DSO reference generator P_D,s, Q_D,s (capture) against step 3 relaxation_limits ref_gen_p_mw / ref_gen_q_mvar (the D-3 model box for DN7 P was +-100.001: 0.001 MW wider); (iii) interface V rows: V-1 per scenario (capture, pu = kV / v_b), V-2 and pinned the expectation (interface_voltage_terminal), against v_min_pu / v_max_pu (TSO) and dn_ref_node_v_pu (DSO); active iff margin <= 1e-6 pu",
  "D4": "cycles k >= 21 of each coupled run, per block: frozen P7 = sum |e + PR| vs sum |e| (factor = sum|e| / sum|e + PR|, held iff >= 5); POST HOC corrected (a) sum |e - price + dual| = sum |o2|, (b) sum |e - price| = sum |o1|, same factor and threshold. Beside: the same on the tail-depth window. Labelled post hoc; never replaces the frozen outcome",
  "D5": "every cycle 1..K of every coupled run. T = sum_a w_a s_a (s_a = settlement_total_unweighted), D = sum_a w_a (s_a - c_a) (c_a = settlement_contracted_unweighted), each exactly as fractions.Fraction of the stored doubles; also math.fsum and the evaluator's float sum. Test (i): |pr_price + T| <= c u S_T, S_T = sum_a |w_a s_a| (exact). Beside (ii): |(gross_contracted_excluded - gross) - D| <= c u S_ii, S_ii = sum_a (|q_full_a| + |q_cont_a| + |w_a s_a| + |w_a c_a|). Beside: S_fine = sum_{b,dn,s,t} w omega |pi| (|P_T,s| + |P_D,s|) (prices from interface_settlement_detail, P from the capture) and the recomputed s_a against the stored s_a. Sign of (pr_price + T) per cycle; Spearman rank correlation (average ranks) of (pr_price + T) and |pr_price + T| with |T| and with the PF residual norm sqrt(boyd_pf_r_expectation_part^2 + boyd_pf_r_deviation_part^2)",
  "dual_parts": "TSO-side dual terms, EUR, as E.priced_residual: fac_pq = w x admm_objective_scale_tso / (tso_base_mva x interface_rating_mva), fac_v = w x admm_objective_scale_tso / v_b^2 (v_b from E.v_base). exp_P = sum_{dn,t} lambda_pf_p_tso x (Pbar_T - Pbar_D) x fac_pq; exp_Q likewise with Q; exp_V = sum dual_expectation_v.tso x (Vbar_T - Vbar_D) x fac_v; dev_X = sum_{dn,s,t} omega_s lambda_dev_x_tso,s x (X_T,s - X_D,s) x fac, X_side,s = Xbar_side + d_side,s (V-2: no V deviation channel, dev_V absent). dual = exp_P + exp_Q + exp_V + dev_P + dev_Q + dev_V",
  "o_series": "o1 = e - price; o2 = e - price + dual; o3 = e - price - dual = e - PR (PR = price + dual)",
  "objective_convention": "EUR of total discounted cost. Coupled arms: Q_b(k) = capture q_blocks per_year_day[b] settlement_excluded_in_full (production primary; pin excluded, salvage separate). e_b(k) = Q_b(k) - w_b C_central (step 4 spec ii_central_and_allowance.blocks[b].w_b_C_central_eur; 2025|Summer is MERGED-ONLY, reported not calibrated)",
  "price_b": "price_b(k) = -sum_{agents a in block b} w_a x settlement_total_unweighted_a (capture per_agent) = +sum w omega pi (P_T - P_D) (sign from the CODE_LINES); computed by E.priced_residual (V-1) and by the per-channel decomposition below (both runs), cross-validated"
 },
